  "description_short": "Girl Scout overnight camp in Thetford, Vermont, with themed programs from three days to two weeks for Girl Scouts who have finished kindergarten through grade 11. Campers sleep in cabins, tentalows, Adirondacks or platform tents, swim in a pool, canoe on a lake, and choose a focus such as archery, arts, cooking, climbing or leadership (Camp Aide, CIT).",
